From: OpenHarmony PC Adaptation <noreply@openharmony.io>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 12:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] cmake: expose focused Cling install components

The package contains the Cling CLI, libcling, public LLVM/Clang/Cling headers,
and Clang resource headers.  Assign the previously unclassified Cling CLI and
header install rules to explicit components so Conan can install that contract
without requiring every unrelated LLVM and Clang tool to be built first.

Origin: https://github.com/root-project/cling/tree/v1.3
Upstream-Status: Not-Submitted [contest adaptation]
Source-Commit: af630d98a4aff3868de049d528402a628da0830a
Modification-Layer: 1 (CMakeLists.txt source)
Knowledge-Ref: E215
---
 CMakeLists.txt              | 10 ++++++++++
 tools/driver/CMakeLists.txt |  1 +
 2 files changed, 11 insertions(+)

diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -405,6 +405,7 @@ include_directories(BEFORE
 if (NOT LLVM_INSTALL_TOOLCHAIN_ONLY)
   install(DIRECTORY include/cling include/cling-c
     DESTINATION include
+    COMPONENT cling-headers
     FILES_MATCHING
     PATTERN "*.def"
     PATTERN "*.h"
@@ -415,9 +416,18 @@ if (NOT LLVM_INSTALL_TOOLCHAIN_ONLY)
   install(DIRECTORY ${CMAKE_CURRENT_BINARY_DIR}/include/cling
     DESTINATION include
+    COMPONENT cling-headers
     FILES_MATCHING
     PATTERN "CMakeFiles" EXCLUDE
     PATTERN "*.inc"
     PATTERN "*.h"
     PATTERN "*.modulemap"
     )
+
+  add_custom_target(cling-headers)
+  set_target_properties(cling-headers PROPERTIES FOLDER "Cling/Resources")
+  if(NOT LLVM_ENABLE_IDE)
+    add_llvm_install_targets(install-cling-headers
+                             DEPENDS cling-headers
+                             COMPONENT cling-headers)
+  endif()
 endif()
diff --git a/tools/driver/CMakeLists.txt b/tools/driver/CMakeLists.txt
--- a/tools/driver/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/tools/driver/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -109,2 +109,3 @@ target_link_libraries(cling PUBLIC ${LIBS})
 install(TARGETS cling
+  COMPONENT cling
   RUNTIME DESTINATION bin)
--
